  m_text: "SURVIVE THE HORDE\n\nThe Hollowed are coming. Survive increasingly difficult
    waves of enemies while defending your home.\n\n\n\t- Survive - Defeat enemies
    and progress through each wave.\n\n\t- Defend - Keep your house standing. Your
    house is essential to your survival.\n\n\t- Fight - Use your attacks and abilities
    to eliminate the Hollowed.\n\n\t- Progress - Earn resources, strengthen your
    defenses, and prepare for tougher waves.\n\n\n\nRemember: Your house is your
    lifeline. If it falls, your run ends."
