      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "GROW STRONGER\n\nEvery wave is an opportunity to improve your chances
    of survival.\n\n\n\t- Money - Purchase upgrades to strengthen your character
    and defenses.\n\n\t- Soulstones - Earn through combat and progression to unlock
    and improve powers.\n\n\t- House Upgrades - Improve your home's defenses to withstand
    enemy attacks.\n\n\t- Armor - Upgrade your equipment to improve your survivability.\n\n\t-
    Attack Upgrades - Increase your attack damage and attack speed.\n\n\nChoose your
    upgrades wisely. Stronger enemies require stronger defenses and better preparation."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
