      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "WELCOME TO THE DEMO\n\nExperience the beginning of The Hollow Grounds
    and see how long you can survive.\n\n\n\t- Wave 10: The Finale - Fight your way
    through the demo's final wave.\n\n\t- Demo Journey - Complete objectives to earn
    additional rewards.\n\n\t- Progression - Earn resources, purchase upgrades, and
    improve your character.\n\n\t- Rebirth - Explore the available rebirth progression,
    subject to demo limits.\n\n\t- Full Release - The demo is a separate experience.
    Your demo progress will not carry\n\tover to the full game.\n\n\nYour journey
    doesn't end here. Survive, grow stronger, and prepare for what lies ahead in
    The Hollow Grounds."
