      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'EVERY WAVE COUNTS

    

    Survival requires more than just attacking.

    

    

    -
    Keep Moving - Avoid standing still when surrounded by enemies.

    

    -
    Manage Stamina - Save your sprint for situations where you need it most.

    

    -
    Protect Your House - Your home is a critical part of your survival.

    

    -
    Upgrade Regularly - Invest your resources to prepare for increasingly difficult
    waves.

    

    - Use Your Abilities - Save powerful effects for dangerous
    situations.

    

    - Know Your Enemies - Learn how different enemies behave
    and adapt your strategy.

    

    

    The longer you survive, the more
    important your preparation becomes.'
