  m_text: "MASTER YOUR POWERS\n\nAbilities give you additional ways to fight the
    Hollowed and survive dangerous encounters.\n\n\nActive Abilities:\n\n\t- Activate
    your equipped power during combat.\n\n\t- Use abilities strategically when enemies
    become overwhelming.\n\n\t- Watch for cooldowns before attempting to use an ability
    again.\n\n\nPassive Abilities:\n\n\t- Provide additional bonuses when unlocked
    and equipped.\n\n\t- Choose passives that complement your playstyle.\n\n\t- Check
    your equipment to make sure your desired passives are equipped.\n\n\nExperiment
    with different combinations to discover what works best for you."
